          {
            "typeName": "dsDescription",
            "multiple": true,
            "typeClass": "compound",
            "value": [
              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "This paper discusses imaging mass cytometry (IMC) data and serum multiplex proteomic (Olink) data that were generated in respectively patients with immune checkpoint inhibitor (ICI) induced or ulcerative colitis \nand ICI-treated patients with or without immune-related adverse events (irAEs) including colitis. R script for data normalization, scaling, cell type annotation and analysis is publicly available at Zenodo (DOI: 10.5281/zenodo.7858216). In this Verse,\nraw data and corresponding meta data as outlined below have been deposited.<br><br>\nType of dataset: restricted data (template 3b)<br>\n===============================<br>\n\n<b>Imaging mass cytometry data (after single-cell segmentation)</b><br>\n\n-- segmented_IMC_data.Rda (restricted)<br>\nThis file contains the raw single-cell segmented channel data for all IMC channels including geometric cell data.<br>\n\n-- IMC_clinical_metadata.csv (restricted)<br>\nThis file contains clinical metadata for the subjects included in segmented_IMC_data.Rda<br>\n\n-- IMC_clinical_metadata_codebook.csv (unrestricted)<br>\nThis file contains codebook with description of all parameters included IMC_clinical_metadata.csv<br>\n\n<b>Serum multiplexed proteomic (Olink) data</b><br>\n\n-- Olink_data.csv (restricted)<br>\nThis file contains raw protein data (serum protein levels) and clinical metadata.<br>\n \n-- Olink_data_codebook.csv (unrestricted)<br>\nThis file contains codebook with description of all parameters included Olink_data.csv<br>\n\n- Patient informed consent form<br>\n-- PIF_v7_UNICIT.pdf (restricted)<br>\nThis file contains the original informed consent form that relates to the UNICIT biobank study as described in the original manuscript."
                },
                "dsDescriptionDate": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionDate",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "2023-04-24"
                }
              }
            ]
